<<<
floruit (-or'ðóït) is a Latin verb meaning he flourished used with a date to give the period to which a person’s activity may be assigned; it is also used as a noun—his f. &c., i.e. the date at which he was active.
===
**floruit** (-or'o͝oĭt) is a Latin verb meaning *he flourished* used with a date to give the period to which a person's activity may be assigned; it is also used as a noun—*his f.* &c., i.e. the date at which he was active.
>>>

